{"change_summary":"No additional source edits were required in this apply-fixes pass. The approved explicit carbonate-equilibrium rollout and its follow-up amendments were already present in the workspace, so this stage verified the integrated state rather than patching code again.","outstanding_risks":["`solve_carbonate_equilibrium()` still uses the freshwater-focused approximation with fixed `Ka2`, so any extension beyond the intended pH 5.5-8.5 aquarium envelope should revisit the chemistry model.","Legacy saves with custom out-of-range source-water catalog entries still deserialize, but runtime water-change actions against those profiles fail validation until the profile is corrected.","The unrelated untracked `.ralph-burning/` directory remains in the worktree and was left untouched."],"steps":[{"description":"Review the prior approved carbonate follow-up state and inspect the current workspace for unresolved source deltas or missing solver/save-path amendments.","order":0,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Apply any remaining carbonate follow-up fixes; skipped because the current worktree already contained the approved implementation and no new actionable amendments remained.","order":1,"status":"skipped"},{"description":"Re-run verification commands to confirm the approved carbonate/state-contract implementation remains green in the current workspace.","order":2,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`git status --short` showed no tracked source deltas; only the unrelated untracked `.ralph-burning/` directory is present.","A codebase scan for the old `6.3 + log10(alk) - log10(DIC)` shortcut and the current carbonate entry points confirmed the workspace still routes through `solve_carbonate_equilibrium()`, `normalize_loaded_carbonate_state()`, `validate_source_water_carbonate_profile()`, and `resolve_carbonate_state()` with no shortcut match present.","`cargo fmt --all --check` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_core -p tank_data -p tank_scenarios` passed across the full tank_core, tank_data, and tank_scenarios suites, including chemistry, save/load, shrimp, source-water validation, and scenario materialization coverage.","`cargo clippy -p tank_core -p tank_data -p tank_scenarios --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed."]}